// Okta User Account Locked Out | T1531 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/okta_user_account_locked_out.yml
displayMessage:"Max sign in attempts exceeded"

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "displayMessage:\"Max sign in attempts exceeded\"",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
